cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FADA: Few-Shot Domain Adaptation via Dynamics Alignment for Humanoid Control"
message: >-
  This repository contains the code release for the FADA paper. If you use
  this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file. FADA is
  built on top of Holosoma (see the `references` entry below); if you also
  use the underlying Holosoma framework, please cite that work as well.
